Package: com.codex.flymemultitasking
Name: Flyme Multitasking - 0.9.64 Landscape Minimal
Description: Minimal landscape mode on the stable 0.9.63 portrait baseline. Landscape adds physical-coordinate corner wheels, a fixed left-side portrait-ratio card, tap-outside close, and a system keyboard layer above the card. Landscape does not add bars, docking, dragging, hiding, or fullscreen handoff.
Maintainer: Codex build for local testing
Author: Codex build for local testing
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
